#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Report the machine-represented completeness of all three Missal families.

This is an accounting composition, not a fourth corpus owner.  It combines the
Propers census, calendar reachability, and Ordinary coverage.  A missing target
inventory is reported as a typed unresolved dimension with ``count: null``;
represented rows are never promoted into an invented completeness denominator.
"""
